 "docs": [
  { "id": "d1760000000001", "title": "Literature review", "html": "<h2>Sleep and stress</h2><p>Sleep consolidates memory (Smith, 2020). Exam stress rises in the first year (Smith &amp; Lee, 2020), and it lingers (Smith et al., 2020). Smith (2020) found the same in a second sample, and the World Health Organization (2022) agrees (World Health Organization, 2022).</p><p>Homework helps little (Lee, 2018). Muller (2007) compared two scripts; see also (Muller, 2007; Bandura, 1977a).</p><ul><li><p>Premchand (1936) wrote of it.</p></li><li><p>Bowlby (1969) and (Bowlby,&nbsp;1969) on attachment.</p></li></ul>" },
  { "id": "d1760000100002", "title": "Methods", "html": "<p>Numbered citations: one [1], a list [2,5-7], reversed [300-1], spaced [ 3 ], an en dash [1–3], by reference [2&#8211;4], zero [0], wide [2-200], too wide [1-201], four digits [1000], [1000,3] and [3,1000], a pair [4, 4], letters [3a], nested [[5]].</p>" },
  { "id": "d1760000200003", "title": "Superscripts", "html": "<p>Plain<sup>3</sup> and<span style=\"vertical-align: super\">4</span>, also<span style=\"vertical-align:super\">5,6</span>; the 20<sup>th</sup> one<sup>1–2</sup>, styled<span style=\"font-size: 10px; vertical-align: super;\">7</span>, subscript<span style=\"vertical-align: sub\">8</span>, upper case<span style=\"VERTICAL-ALIGN: SUPER\">9</span>, coloured<span style=\"color: red\">10</span>, nested<sup>1<sup>2</sup></sup>, a span in a sup<sup><span style=\"vertical-align: super\">11</span></sup>, by reference<span style=\"vertical-align:&#32;super\">12</span>, single quotes<span style='color: blue; vertical-align: super'>13</span>, a capitalised attribute<span STYLE=\"vertical-align: super\">15</span>, a repeated attribute<span style=\"color: red\" style=\"vertical-align: super\">14</span>, a capital tag<SUP>2,4</SUP>, letters<sup>a</sup>, a range<sup>3-5</sup>.</p>" },
  { "id": "d1760000300004", "title": "", "html": "<div>Mixed: Smith (2020) and [1] in one place, a superscript<sup>[3]</sup> in brackets, Lee (2018)<sup>14</sup>, and Muller (2007)<sup>14</sup>.</div><p><br></p><p>The end [14].</p>" },
