  { "id": "d1760000500006", "title": "Boundaries", "html": "<p>GoldSmith (2020) is not a citation of Smith; Smithson (2020) is not either; Müllerová (2018) is not Müller; but (Müller, 2018) is, and Müller&nbsp;(2018) too; St. Clair (2019) counts; StX Clair (2019) does not.</p><p>A long gap: Smith and a great many other colleagues of hers, 2020; a short gap: Smith and colleagues, 2020; a cut: Smith; 2020; a letter: Smith (2020a); five digits: Smith (20201); and (Rao, n.d.), (Author, 2019) and (Anonymous, 2015).</p>" }
